# xbench — cross-encoder AV1 still-picture benchmark, provenance
# Companion to benchmarks/xbench_2026-08-01.md and the stage TSVs.

date                 2026-08-01
box                  Apple M4 Pro, 12 cores, 24 GiB, macOS Darwin 25.5.0 (arm64)
compiler             rustc 1.97.1 (8bab26f4f 2026-07-14) / Apple clang 21.0.0 (clang-2100.1.1.101)
build flags          --release, NO -C target-cpu=native (runtime SIMD dispatch, what users get)
threading            SINGLE THREAD for all four encoders
                       svt-c    : cfg.level_of_parallelism = 1  (--lp 1)
                       svt-rust : EncodePipeline::with_thread_count(1)
                       zenrav1e : Config::with_threads(1), tiles = 1
                       zenav1-aom: single-threaded by construction (no threading in the port)
nice                 every measured run under `nice -n 19`

